      },
      "dc:source": "australian-broadcasting-corporation-act-1983.pdf, p.7",
      "values:originalText": "(1) Part I, Part II (other than sections 5, 6 and 8), Part III and\nsections 34, 69 and 83 shall come into operation on the day on\nwhich this Act receives the Royal Assent.\n(2) The remaining provisions of this Act shall come into operation on\na day to be fixed by Proclamation.",
      "skos:definition": "(1) Part I, Part II (other than sections 5, 6 and 8), Part III and\nsections 34, 69 and 83 shall come into operation on the day on\nwhich this Act receives the Royal Assent.\n(2) The remaining provisions of this Act shall come into operation on\na day to be fixed by Proclamation.",
      "cml:hasPart": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:australian-broadcasting-corporation-act-1983-sec-2-ss-1"
        },
        {
