    {
      "@id": "concept:australian-broadcasting-corporation-act-1983-sec-3",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "3 Interpretation",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/australian-broadcasting-corporation-act-1983#sec-3"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "australian-broadcasting-corporation-act-1983.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "australian-broadcasting-corporation-act-1983.pdf, p.7",
      "values:originalText": "(1) In this Act, unless the contrary intention appears:\nACMA means the Australian Communications and Media\nAuthority.\nadvisory committee means an advisory committee established\nunder subsection 11(8).\nAdvisory Council means:\n(a) the Australian Broadcasting Corporation Advisory Council\nestablished under subsection 11(1); or\n(b) an Advisory Council established under subsection 11(2) in\nrelation to a State, Territory or region.\nallowance does not include an allowance in the nature of\nremuneration.",
      "skos:definition": "(1) In this Act, unless the contrary intention appears:\nACMA means the Australian Communications and Media\nAuthority.\nadvisory committee means an advisory committee established\nunder subsection 11(8).\nAdvisory Council means:\n(a) the Australian Broadcasting Corporation Advisory Council\nestablished under subsection 11(1); or\n(b) an Advisory Council established under subsection 11(2) in\nrelation to a State, Territory or region.\nallowance does not include an allowance in the nature of\nremuneration.",
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:australian-broadcasting-corporation-act-1983-sec-3-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:australian-broadcasting-corporation-act-1983-sec-3-logic-deontic-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:australian-broadcasting-corporation-act-1983-sec-3-logic-descriptionlogic-2"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "de7199a614abccf18cde1dabc2d429674a1d386cd2d6c650e8c6fa6eeadb9f08",
      "skos:note": "Definitions for key terms in the Act."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/australian-broadcasting-corporation-act-1983#sec-3",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "3 Interpretation",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 7,
      "values:originalText": "(1) In this Act, unless the contrary intention appears:\nACMA means the Australian Communications and Media\nAuthority.\nadvisory committee means an advisory committee established\nunder subsection 11(8).\nAdvisory Council means:\n(a) the Australian Broadcasting Corporation Advisory Council\nestablished under subsection 11(1); or\n(b) an Advisory Council established under subsection 11(2) in\nrelation to a State, Territory or region.\nallowance does not include an allowance in the nature of\nremuneration."
    },
