    {
      "@id": "concept:australian-broadcasting-corporation-act-1983-sec-6a",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "6A Datacasting functions",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/australian-broadcasting-corporation-act-1983#sec-6a"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "australian-broadcasting-corporation-act-1983.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "australian-broadcasting-corporation-act-1983.pdf, p.14",
      "values:originalText": "(1) If:\n(a) the Corporation applies for a datacasting licence; and\n(b) the licence is allocated to the Corporation;\nthen, in addition to the functions conferred on the Corporation\nunder section 6, the Corporation has the function of providing a\ndatacasting service under, and in accordance with the conditions\nof, the licence.\n(2) However, subsection (1) is not intended to impose any obligation\non the Corporation, in relation to the provision of such a service,\nbeyond that imposed on the Corporation as holder of such a\nlicence.",
      "skos:definition": "(1) If:\n(a) the Corporation applies for a datacasting licence; and\n(b) the licence is allocated to the Corporation;\nthen, in addition to the functions conferred on the Corporation\nunder section 6, the Corporation has the function of providing a\ndatacasting service under, and in accordance with the conditions\nof, the licence.\n(2) However, subsection (1) is not intended to impose any obligation\non the Corporation, in relation to the provision of such a service,\nbeyond that imposed on the Corporation as holder of such a\nlicence.",
      "cml:hasPart": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:australian-broadcasting-corporation-act-1983-sec-6a-ss-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:australian-broadcasting-corporation-act-1983-sec-6a-ss-2"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "e68ae567a2b19b4b4435ccb865c7f50d0e162b9bc263bb16fe246a1a3806a35f"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/australian-broadcasting-corporation-act-1983#sec-6a",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "6A Datacasting functions",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 14,
      "values:originalText": "(1) If:\n(a) the Corporation applies for a datacasting licence; and\n(b) the licence is allocated to the Corporation;\nthen, in addition to the functions conferred on the Corporation\nunder section 6, the Corporation has the function of providing a\ndatacasting service under, and in accordance with the conditions\nof, the licence.\n(2) However, subsection (1) is not intended to impose any obligation\non the Corporation, in relation to the provision of such a service,\nbeyond that imposed on the Corporation as holder of such a\nlicence."
    },
