      },
      "dc:source": "australian-broadcasting-corporation-act-1983.pdf, p.16",
      "values:originalText": "(5) An Advisory Council shall consist of such persons as the Board\nfrom time to time appoints.\n\n\nEstablishment, functions and management of the Corporation  Part II\n\nSection 11\nAustralian Broadcasting Corporation Act 1983\nCompilation date: 18/02/2022\nRegistered: 23/02/2022",
      "skos:definition": "(5) An Advisory Council shall consist of such persons as the Board\nfrom time to time appoints.\n\n\nEstablishment, functions and management of the Corporation  Part II\n\nSection 11\nAustralian Broadcasting Corporation Act 1983\nCompilation date: 18/02/2022\nRegistered: 23/02/2022",
      "values:partOf": {
