      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:australian-broadcasting-corporation-act-1983-sec-11-ss-8",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "11(8) Advisory Councils and committees",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/australian-broadcasting-corporation-act-1983#sec-11-ss-8"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "australian-broadcasting-corporation-act-1983.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "australian-broadcasting-corporation-act-1983.pdf, p.16",
      "values:originalText": "(8) In addition to Advisory Councils, the Board may establish advisory\ncommittees, consisting of such persons as the Board appoints, to\nfurnish advice to the Board on particular matters or classes of\nmatters relating to the functions of the Corporation.",
      "skos:definition": "(8) In addition to Advisory Councils, the Board may establish advisory\ncommittees, consisting of such persons as the Board appoints, to\nfurnish advice to the Board on particular matters or classes of\nmatters relating to the functions of the Corporation.",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:australian-broadcasting-corporation-act-1983-sec-11"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:australian-broadcasting-corporation-act-1983-sec-11-ss-8-norm"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "33382318b25925bf4904f6f4e24afece09ace8c1501ad68e2af0240a9e35cf32",
      "skos:note": "Establishment of advisory committees by the Board."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/australian-broadcasting-corporation-act-1983#sec-11-ss-8",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "11(8) Advisory Councils and committees",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 16,
      "values:originalText": "(8) In addition to Advisory Councils, the Board may establish advisory\ncommittees, consisting of such persons as the Board appoints, to\nfurnish advice to the Board on particular matters or classes of\nmatters relating to the functions of the Corporation."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:australian-broadcasting-corporation-act-1983-sec-11-ss-8-norm",
      "@type": "values:Undertaking",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
      },
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:australian-broadcasting-corporation-act-1983-sec-11-ss-8"
      },
      "values:deonticStatus": {
        "@id": "values:HeuristicDerived"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:australian-broadcasting-corporation-act-1983-sec-11-ss-9",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "11(9) Advisory Councils and committees",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/australian-broadcasting-corporation-act-1983#sec-11-ss-9"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "australian-broadcasting-corporation-act-1983.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "australian-broadcasting-corporation-act-1983.pdf, p.16",
      "values:originalText": "(9) The Board may determine:\n(a) the manner in which an Advisory Council or advisory\ncommittee is to perform its functions; and\n(b) the procedure to be followed at or in relation to meetings of\nan Advisory Council or advisory committee, including\nmatters with respect to:\n(i) the convening of meetings of the Advisory Council or\nadvisory committee;\n(ii) the number of members of the Advisory Council or\nadvisory committee who are to constitute a quorum;\n(iii) the selection of a member of the Advisory Council or\nadvisory committee to preside at meetings of the\nAdvisory Council or advisory committee at which the\nChairperson and the Deputy Chairperson of the\nAdvisory Council or advisory committee are not\npresent; and\n(iv) the manner in which questions arising at a meeting of\nthe Advisory Council or advisory committee are to be\ndecided;\nand the Managing Director shall notify each Advisory Council or\nadvisory committee in writing of any determination by the Board\nunder this subsection in relation to that Advisory Council or\nadvisory committee.",
      "skos:definition": "(9) The Board may determine:\n(a) the manner in which an Advisory Council or advisory\ncommittee is to perform its functions; and\n(b) the procedure to be followed at or in relation to meetings of\nan Advisory Council or advisory committee, including\nmatters with respect to:\n(i) the convening of meetings of the Advisory Council or\nadvisory committee;\n(ii) the number of members of the Advisory Council or\nadvisory committee who are to constitute a quorum;\n(iii) the selection of a member of the Advisory Council or\nadvisory committee to preside at meetings of the\nAdvisory Council or advisory committee at which the\nChairperson and the Deputy Chairperson of the\nAdvisory Council or advisory committee are not\npresent; and\n(iv) the manner in which questions arising at a meeting of\nthe Advisory Council or advisory committee are to be\ndecided;\nand the Managing Director shall notify each Advisory Council or\nadvisory committee in writing of any determination by the Board\nunder this subsection in relation to that Advisory Council or\nadvisory committee.",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:australian-broadcasting-corporation-act-1983-sec-11"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:australian-broadcasting-corporation-act-1983-sec-11-ss-9-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:australian-broadcasting-corporation-act-1983-sec-11-ss-9-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "23adb530dcc88400381a42b32186fb3b2ef2fb176016e14d2241e49b1e4ee89c",
      "skos:note": "The Board may determine certain procedures for Advisory Councils and committees."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/australian-broadcasting-corporation-act-1983#sec-11-ss-9",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "11(9) Advisory Councils and committees",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 16,
      "values:originalText": "(9) The Board may determine:\n(a) the manner in which an Advisory Council or advisory\ncommittee is to perform its functions; and\n(b) the procedure to be followed at or in relation to meetings of\nan Advisory Council or advisory committee, including\nmatters with respect to:\n(i) the convening of meetings of the Advisory Council or\nadvisory committee;\n(ii) the number of members of the Advisory Council or\nadvisory committee who are to constitute a quorum;\n(iii) the selection of a member of the Advisory Council or\nadvisory committee to preside at meetings of the\nAdvisory Council or advisory committee at which the\nChairperson and the Deputy Chairperson of the\nAdvisory Council or advisory committee are not\npresent; and\n(iv) the manner in which questions arising at a meeting of\nthe Advisory Council or advisory committee are to be\ndecided;\nand the Managing Director shall notify each Advisory Council or\nadvisory committee in writing of any determination by the Board\nunder this subsection in relation to that Advisory Council or\nadvisory committee."
    },
