      "cml:premiseText": "(2) Where the person holding office as Managing Director is re-appointed, the re-appointment shall be for a period not exceeding 5 years.",
      "cml:conclusionText": "The re-appointment period must diffuse into the future with a maximum duration of 5 years."
    },
    {
