      "values:originalText": "(3) The Managing Director holds office, subject to this Part, on such\nterms and conditions as are determined by the Board.",
      "skos:definition": "(3) The Managing Director holds office, subject to this Part, on such\nterms and conditions as are determined by the Board.",
      "values:partOf": {
