      "cml:premiseText": "(a) the person is an employee of the Corporation who, by the terms of his or her employment, is required to devote at least 22 hours a week to the duties of that employment; or (b) the person (the relevant person) performs services for the Corporation, under the direction and control of the Managing Director or an employee of the Corporation, under:"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:australian-broadcasting-corporation-act-1983-sec-13a-ss-2-logic-ltl-4",
      "@type": "cml:LogicApplication",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:LTL"
      },
      "cml:operator": "occursBefore",
      "cml:logicSummary": "Eligibility criteria occurs before contract commencement",
      "cml:executionSurface": "modalities::temporal_ltl",
      "cml:confidence": {
        "@value": 1.0,
        "@type": "xsd:decimal"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:premiseText": "(a) the person is an employee of the Corporation who, by the terms of his or her employment, is required to devote at least 22 hours a week to the duties of that employment; or (b) the person (the relevant person) performs services for the Corporation, under the direction and control of the Managing Director or an employee of the Corporation, under:"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:australian-broadcasting-corporation-act-1983-sec-13a-ss-3",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "13A(3) Staff-elected Director",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/australian-broadcasting-corporation-act-1983#sec-13a-ss-3"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "australian-broadcasting-corporation-act-1983.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "australian-broadcasting-corporation-act-1983.pdf, p.22",
      "values:originalText": "(3) If a person who has been nominated as a candidate for election as\nthe staff-elected Director ceases to be eligible to be such a\ncandidate after having been nominated and before the day on\nwhich the election takes place:\n(a) if there are 2 or more other eligible candidates—the election\nmust be held as if the person were not a candidate; or\n(b) if there is only one other eligible candidate—the other\ncandidate must be declared to be elected; or\n(c) if there is no other eligible candidate—fresh invitations must\nbe issued for the nomination of candidates.\nCandidate may vote at election",
      "skos:definition": "(3) If a person who has been nominated as a candidate for election as\nthe staff-elected Director ceases to be eligible to be such a\ncandidate after having been nominated and before the day on\nwhich the election takes place:\n(a) if there are 2 or more other eligible candidates—the election\nmust be held as if the person were not a candidate; or\n(b) if there is only one other eligible candidate—the other\ncandidate must be declared to be elected; or\n(c) if there is no other eligible candidate—fresh invitations must\nbe issued for the nomination of candidates.\nCandidate may vote at election",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:australian-broadcasting-corporation-act-1983-sec-13a"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
