    {
      "@id": "concept:australian-broadcasting-corporation-act-1983-sec-13a-ss-5",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "13A(5) Staff-elected Director",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/australian-broadcasting-corporation-act-1983#sec-13a-ss-5"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "australian-broadcasting-corporation-act-1983.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "australian-broadcasting-corporation-act-1983.pdf, p.22",
      "values:originalText": "(5) Subject to sections 16 and 18, the person who is the staff-elected\nDirector holds office on a part-time basis for a period of 5 years\nstarting:\n(a) if, on the day on which the person is declared to be elected,\nthe person already holds office as the staff-elected Director\nbecause of a previous election—on the day after the day on\nwhich that person would, but for having been re-elected,\ncease to hold office; or\n(b) if, on the day on which the person is declared to be elected,\nanother person holds office as the staff-elected Director\nbecause of a previous election—on the day after the day on\nwhich the other person ceases to hold office; or\n(c) in any other case—on the day on which the person is\ndeclared to be elected.",
      "skos:definition": "(5) Subject to sections 16 and 18, the person who is the staff-elected\nDirector holds office on a part-time basis for a period of 5 years\nstarting:\n(a) if, on the day on which the person is declared to be elected,\nthe person already holds office as the staff-elected Director\nbecause of a previous election—on the day after the day on\nwhich that person would, but for having been re-elected,\ncease to hold office; or\n(b) if, on the day on which the person is declared to be elected,\nanother person holds office as the staff-elected Director\nbecause of a previous election—on the day after the day on\nwhich the other person ceases to hold office; or\n(c) in any other case—on the day on which the person is\ndeclared to be elected.",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:australian-broadcasting-corporation-act-1983-sec-13a"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:australian-broadcasting-corporation-act-1983-sec-13a-ss-5-norm"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "7aaa62a1d08daf328e63153420e203a8d975bf9450d1a3279abddf4d6ee17e04",
      "skos:note": "Term of office for staff-elected Director"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/australian-broadcasting-corporation-act-1983#sec-13a-ss-5",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "13A(5) Staff-elected Director",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 22,
      "values:originalText": "(5) Subject to sections 16 and 18, the person who is the staff-elected\nDirector holds office on a part-time basis for a period of 5 years\nstarting:\n(a) if, on the day on which the person is declared to be elected,\nthe person already holds office as the staff-elected Director\nbecause of a previous election—on the day after the day on\nwhich that person would, but for having been re-elected,\ncease to hold office; or\n(b) if, on the day on which the person is declared to be elected,\nanother person holds office as the staff-elected Director\nbecause of a previous election—on the day after the day on\nwhich the other person ceases to hold office; or\n(c) in any other case—on the day on which the person is\ndeclared to be elected."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:australian-broadcasting-corporation-act-1983-sec-13a-ss-5-norm",
      "@type": "values:Undertaking",
      "cml:modality": {
