    {
      "@id": "concept:australian-broadcasting-corporation-act-1983-sec-17",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "17 Disclosure of interests",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/australian-broadcasting-corporation-act-1983#sec-17"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "australian-broadcasting-corporation-act-1983.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "australian-broadcasting-corporation-act-1983.pdf, p.25",
      "values:originalText": "(3) A member of an Advisory Council, or of an advisory committee,\nwho has a direct or indirect pecuniary interest in a matter being\nconsidered or about to be considered by the Advisory Council or\nby the committee shall, as soon as possible after the relevant facts\nhave come to his or her knowledge, disclose the nature of the\ninterest at a meeting of the Advisory Council or of the committee.\n(4) A disclosure under subsection (3) shall be recorded in the minutes\nof the meeting of the Advisory Council or of the committee and the\nmember shall not:\n(a) be present during any deliberation of the Advisory Council or\nof the committee with respect to that matter; or\n(b) take part in any decision of the Advisory Council or of the\ncommittee with respect to that matter.",
      "skos:definition": "(3) A member of an Advisory Council, or of an advisory committee,\nwho has a direct or indirect pecuniary interest in a matter being\nconsidered or about to be considered by the Advisory Council or\nby the committee shall, as soon as possible after the relevant facts\nhave come to his or her knowledge, disclose the nature of the\ninterest at a meeting of the Advisory Council or of the committee.\n(4) A disclosure under subsection (3) shall be recorded in the minutes\nof the meeting of the Advisory Council or of the committee and the\nmember shall not:\n(a) be present during any deliberation of the Advisory Council or\nof the committee with respect to that matter; or\n(b) take part in any decision of the Advisory Council or of the\ncommittee with respect to that matter.",
      "cml:hasPart": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:australian-broadcasting-corporation-act-1983-sec-17-ss-3"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:australian-broadcasting-corporation-act-1983-sec-17-ss-4"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "f1a46b5bce742abd3a2662035b47636941a610140cb605a07303ab30f1cb76ef"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/australian-broadcasting-corporation-act-1983#sec-17",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "17 Disclosure of interests",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 25,
      "values:originalText": "(3) A member of an Advisory Council, or of an advisory committee,\nwho has a direct or indirect pecuniary interest in a matter being\nconsidered or about to be considered by the Advisory Council or\nby the committee shall, as soon as possible after the relevant facts\nhave come to his or her knowledge, disclose the nature of the\ninterest at a meeting of the Advisory Council or of the committee.\n(4) A disclosure under subsection (3) shall be recorded in the minutes\nof the meeting of the Advisory Council or of the committee and the\nmember shall not:\n(a) be present during any deliberation of the Advisory Council or\nof the committee with respect to that matter; or\n(b) take part in any decision of the Advisory Council or of the\ncommittee with respect to that matter."
    },
