      "dc:source": "australian-broadcasting-corporation-act-1983.pdf, p.26",
      "values:originalText": "(6) The appointment of a person to act as Managing Director ceases to\nhave effect if he or she resigns the appointment by writing signed\nby him or her delivered to the Chairperson or, if a Director is\nacting as Chairperson, to the Director so acting.",
      "skos:definition": "(6) The appointment of a person to act as Managing Director ceases to\nhave effect if he or she resigns the appointment by writing signed\nby him or her delivered to the Chairperson or, if a Director is\nacting as Chairperson, to the Director so acting.",
