      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 26,
      "values:originalText": "(6) The appointment of a person to act as Managing Director ceases to\nhave effect if he or she resigns the appointment by writing signed\nby him or her delivered to the Chairperson or, if a Director is\nacting as Chairperson, to the Director so acting."
    },
