      },
      "dc:source": "australian-broadcasting-corporation-act-1983.pdf, p.26",
      "values:originalText": "(8) A reference in this Act other than this section and section 9 to the\nManaging Director shall, if a person is acting as Managing\nDirector, be construed as a reference to the person so acting.",
