    {
      "@id": "concept:australian-broadcasting-corporation-act-1983-sec-22-ss-5",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "22(5) Meetings of the Board",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/australian-broadcasting-corporation-act-1983#sec-22-ss-5"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "australian-broadcasting-corporation-act-1983.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "australian-broadcasting-corporation-act-1983.pdf, p.28",
      "values:originalText": "(5) In the absence of both the Chairperson and the Deputy Chairperson\nfrom a meeting of the Board:\n(a) if another Director is acting as Chairperson—that Director\nshall preside at the meeting; or\n(b) in any other case—the Directors present shall elect one of\ntheir number other than the Managing Director to preside at\nthe meeting.",
      "skos:definition": "(5) In the absence of both the Chairperson and the Deputy Chairperson\nfrom a meeting of the Board:\n(a) if another Director is acting as Chairperson—that Director\nshall preside at the meeting; or\n(b) in any other case—the Directors present shall elect one of\ntheir number other than the Managing Director to preside at\nthe meeting.",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:australian-broadcasting-corporation-act-1983-sec-22"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:australian-broadcasting-corporation-act-1983-sec-22-ss-5-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:australian-broadcasting-corporation-act-1983-sec-22-ss-5-logic-deontic-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:australian-broadcasting-corporation-act-1983-sec-22-ss-5-logic-deontic-2"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:australian-broadcasting-corporation-act-1983-sec-22-ss-5-logic-alleninterval-3"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:australian-broadcasting-corporation-act-1983-sec-22-ss-5-logic-ltl-4"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:australian-broadcasting-corporation-act-1983-sec-22-ss-5-logic-deontic-5"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "e48edb9bd363ad4455632de40807a203635a83edfd8829cb4d3d15bf9e3d8fbb",
      "skos:note": "Directors must elect a presiding Director in the absence of the Chairperson and Deputy Chairperson."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/australian-broadcasting-corporation-act-1983#sec-22-ss-5",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "22(5) Meetings of the Board",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 28,
      "values:originalText": "(5) In the absence of both the Chairperson and the Deputy Chairperson\nfrom a meeting of the Board:\n(a) if another Director is acting as Chairperson—that Director\nshall preside at the meeting; or\n(b) in any other case—the Directors present shall elect one of\ntheir number other than the Managing Director to preside at\nthe meeting."
    },
