      "skos:definition": "(1) The Corporation may, either generally or as otherwise provided by\nthe instrument of delegation, by writing under its seal, delegate to a\nDirector or to an employee of the Corporation all or any of its\npowers under this Act, the regulations or the rules, other than this\npower of delegation.",
