    {
      "@id": "concept:australian-broadcasting-corporation-act-1983-sec-24",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "24 Delegation by Managing Director",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/australian-broadcasting-corporation-act-1983#sec-24"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "australian-broadcasting-corporation-act-1983.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "australian-broadcasting-corporation-act-1983.pdf, p.30",
      "values:originalText": "(1) The Managing Director may, either generally or as otherwise\nprovided by the instrument of delegation, by writing signed by him\nor her, delegate to an employee of the Corporation all or any of his\nor her powers under this Act, the regulations or the rules, other\nthan this power of delegation.\n(2) A power delegated under this section, when exercised by the\ndelegate, shall, for the purposes of this Act, the regulations or the\nrules, be deemed to have been exercised by the Managing Director.\n\n\nThe Board of Directors and the Managing Director  Part III\n\nSection 24\nAustralian Broadcasting Corporation Act 1983\nCompilation date: 18/02/2022\nRegistered: 23/02/2022\n(3) A delegation under this section does not prevent the exercise of a\npower by the Managing Director.",
      "skos:definition": "(1) The Managing Director may, either generally or as otherwise\nprovided by the instrument of delegation, by writing signed by him\nor her, delegate to an employee of the Corporation all or any of his\nor her powers under this Act, the regulations or the rules, other\nthan this power of delegation.\n(2) A power delegated under this section, when exercised by the\ndelegate, shall, for the purposes of this Act, the regulations or the\nrules, be deemed to have been exercised by the Managing Director.\n\n\nThe Board of Directors and the Managing Director  Part III\n\nSection 24\nAustralian Broadcasting Corporation Act 1983\nCompilation date: 18/02/2022\nRegistered: 23/02/2022\n(3) A delegation under this section does not prevent the exercise of a\npower by the Managing Director.",
      "cml:hasPart": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:australian-broadcasting-corporation-act-1983-sec-24-ss-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:australian-broadcasting-corporation-act-1983-sec-24-ss-2"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:australian-broadcasting-corporation-act-1983-sec-24-ss-3"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "6b49244e3042bcf8c788bf24cd0ebe16e826d59533669f209915d72fdb6ff8c2"
    },
    {
