    {
      "@id": "concept:australian-broadcasting-corporation-act-1983-sec-24b-ss-4",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "24B(4) Functions",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/australian-broadcasting-corporation-act-1983#sec-24b-ss-4"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "australian-broadcasting-corporation-act-1983.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "australian-broadcasting-corporation-act-1983.pdf, p.32",
      "values:originalText": "(4) The Nomination Panel may conduct one selection process for 2 or\nmore of the following appointments (including any combination of\nthem):\n(a) an appointment of the Chairperson;\n(b) an appointment of a Director referred to in\nparagraph 12(1)(c);\n(c) an appointment of the Chairperson under the Special\nBroadcasting Service Act 1991;",
      "skos:definition": "(4) The Nomination Panel may conduct one selection process for 2 or\nmore of the following appointments (including any combination of\nthem):\n(a) an appointment of the Chairperson;\n(b) an appointment of a Director referred to in\nparagraph 12(1)(c);\n(c) an appointment of the Chairperson under the Special\nBroadcasting Service Act 1991;",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:australian-broadcasting-corporation-act-1983-sec-24b"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:australian-broadcasting-corporation-act-1983-sec-24b-ss-4-norm"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "77e3fcb73ab5893aa86840baf5e2a98101424659c973a57eb143f33abe29a629",
      "skos:note": "Nomination Panel may conduct one selection process for certain appointments."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/australian-broadcasting-corporation-act-1983#sec-24b-ss-4",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "24B(4) Functions",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 32,
      "values:originalText": "(4) The Nomination Panel may conduct one selection process for 2 or\nmore of the following appointments (including any combination of\nthem):\n(a) an appointment of the Chairperson;\n(b) an appointment of a Director referred to in\nparagraph 12(1)(c);\n(c) an appointment of the Chairperson under the Special\nBroadcasting Service Act 1991;"
    },
