      },
      "dc:source": "australian-broadcasting-corporation-act-1983.pdf, p.39",
      "values:originalText": "A member of the Nomination Panel holds office on the terms and\nconditions (if any) in relation to matters not covered by this Act\nthat are determined by the Secretary of the Prime Minister’s\nDepartment.",
      "skos:definition": "A member of the Nomination Panel holds office on the terms and\nconditions (if any) in relation to matters not covered by this Act\nthat are determined by the Secretary of the Prime Minister’s\nDepartment.",
      "cml:asserts": [
