      },
      "dc:source": "australian-broadcasting-corporation-act-1983.pdf, p.42",
      "values:originalText": "(1) The Minister must, by legislative instrument, determine selection\ncriteria for the appointment of a Director referred to in\nparagraph 12(1)(b) or (c).\n(2) The Minister may, in relation to a particular such appointment,\ngive a written notice to the Nomination Panel of additional\nselection criteria for that appointment.\n(3) A notice under subsection (2) is not a legislative instrument.",
      "skos:definition": "(1) The Minister must, by legislative instrument, determine selection\ncriteria for the appointment of a Director referred to in\nparagraph 12(1)(b) or (c).\n(2) The Minister may, in relation to a particular such appointment,\ngive a written notice to the Nomination Panel of additional\nselection criteria for that appointment.\n(3) A notice under subsection (2) is not a legislative instrument.",
      "cml:hasPart": [
