      "cml:integrityHash": "5d217408b30fc7d3a6ea641eccfabe3e593fe35ce568a5e0fe087bed6d16c8c5"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/australian-broadcasting-corporation-act-1983#sec-24w",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "24W Selection criteria",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 42,
      "values:originalText": "(1) The Minister must, by legislative instrument, determine selection\ncriteria for the appointment of a Director referred to in\nparagraph 12(1)(b) or (c).\n(2) The Minister may, in relation to a particular such appointment,\ngive a written notice to the Nomination Panel of additional\nselection criteria for that appointment.\n(3) A notice under subsection (2) is not a legislative instrument."
