      },
      "dc:source": "australian-broadcasting-corporation-act-1983.pdf, p.49",
      "values:originalText": "(4) Without affecting the obligations of the Managing Director under\nsubsection (3), the Corporation may also procure news and\ninformation relating to current events from such news agencies and\nother sources, whether within or outside Australia, as the Board\nthinks fit.",
      "skos:definition": "(4) Without affecting the obligations of the Managing Director under\nsubsection (3), the Corporation may also procure news and\ninformation relating to current events from such news agencies and\nother sources, whether within or outside Australia, as the Board\nthinks fit.",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:australian-broadcasting-corporation-act-1983-sec-27"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
