      "dc:source": "australian-broadcasting-corporation-act-1983.pdf, p.49",
      "values:originalText": "(5) Subsection (2) does not apply to:\n(a) a subscription broadcasting service within the meaning of\nsection 16 of the Broadcasting Services Act 1992; or\n(b) a subscription narrowcasting service within the meaning of\nsection 17 of that Act; or\n(c) an open narrowcasting service within the meaning of\nsection 18 of that Act;\nunless the service is specified by the Minister under subsection (6).",
      "skos:definition": "(5) Subsection (2) does not apply to:\n(a) a subscription broadcasting service within the meaning of\nsection 16 of the Broadcasting Services Act 1992; or\n(b) a subscription narrowcasting service within the meaning of\nsection 17 of that Act; or\n(c) an open narrowcasting service within the meaning of\nsection 18 of that Act;\nunless the service is specified by the Minister under subsection (6).",
