      "dc:source": "australian-broadcasting-corporation-act-1983.pdf, p.50",
      "values:originalText": "(2) The Corporation may from time to time determine charges payable\nin respect of any matter or activity referred to in subsection (1),\nwith a view to raising as much net revenue as is practicable, having\nregard to the proper performance of its functions and to the matter\nor activity concerned.",
      "skos:definition": "(2) The Corporation may from time to time determine charges payable\nin respect of any matter or activity referred to in subsection (1),\nwith a view to raising as much net revenue as is practicable, having\nregard to the proper performance of its functions and to the matter\nor activity concerned.",
