      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "32 Staff of Corporation",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 56,
      "values:originalText": "(1) The Corporation may engage such employees as are necessary for\nthe performance of its functions and the exercise of its powers.\n(2) The terms and conditions of employment shall be determined by\nthe Corporation."
    },
