    {
      "@id": "concept:australian-broadcasting-corporation-act-1983-sec-70b-ss-7",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "70B(7) Borrowings otherwise than from Commonwealth",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/australian-broadcasting-corporation-act-1983#sec-70b-ss-7"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "australian-broadcasting-corporation-act-1983.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "australian-broadcasting-corporation-act-1983.pdf, p.58",
      "values:originalText": "(7) For the purposes of this section, if:\n(a) the Corporation issues an instrument that acknowledges a\ndebt;\n(b) the instrument is issued in consideration of the payment or\ndeposit of money; and\n(c) the instrument is issued in relation to a transaction that is not\na routine operational transaction;\nthe Corporation shall be taken to raise money otherwise than by\nborrowing and the amount of money raised shall be taken to be the\namount of the money paid or deposited.\n\n\nFinance  Part VI\n\nSection 70C\nAustralian Broadcasting Corporation Act 1983\nCompilation date: 18/02/2022\nRegistered: 23/02/2022",
      "skos:definition": "(7) For the purposes of this section, if:\n(a) the Corporation issues an instrument that acknowledges a\ndebt;\n(b) the instrument is issued in consideration of the payment or\ndeposit of money; and\n(c) the instrument is issued in relation to a transaction that is not\na routine operational transaction;\nthe Corporation shall be taken to raise money otherwise than by\nborrowing and the amount of money raised shall be taken to be the\namount of the money paid or deposited.\n\n\nFinance  Part VI\n\nSection 70C\nAustralian Broadcasting Corporation Act 1983\nCompilation date: 18/02/2022\nRegistered: 23/02/2022",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:australian-broadcasting-corporation-act-1983-sec-70b"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:australian-broadcasting-corporation-act-1983-sec-70b-ss-7-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:australian-broadcasting-corporation-act-1983-sec-70b-ss-7-logic-deontic-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:australian-broadcasting-corporation-act-1983-sec-70b-ss-7-logic-deontic-2"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:australian-broadcasting-corporation-act-1983-sec-70b-ss-7-logic-alleninterval-3"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:australian-broadcasting-corporation-act-1983-sec-70b-ss-7-logic-ltl-4"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:australian-broadcasting-corporation-act-1983-sec-70b-ss-7-logic-deontic-5"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "566bb717a6d4706a30826b8c32aa7b6dea9e46ee76a19a1192d1b0ba675f6f8e",
      "skos:note": "The Corporation must acknowledge a debt and issue an instrument in consideration of payment or deposit for non-routine transactions."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/australian-broadcasting-corporation-act-1983#sec-70b-ss-7",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "70B(7) Borrowings otherwise than from Commonwealth",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 58,
      "values:originalText": "(7) For the purposes of this section, if:\n(a) the Corporation issues an instrument that acknowledges a\ndebt;\n(b) the instrument is issued in consideration of the payment or\ndeposit of money; and\n(c) the instrument is issued in relation to a transaction that is not\na routine operational transaction;\nthe Corporation shall be taken to raise money otherwise than by\nborrowing and the amount of money raised shall be taken to be the\namount of the money paid or deposited.\n\n\nFinance  Part VI\n\nSection 70C\nAustralian Broadcasting Corporation Act 1983\nCompilation date: 18/02/2022\nRegistered: 23/02/2022"
    },
    {
