      "values:originalText": "(8) For the purposes of this section, if:\n(a) the Corporation issues an instrument that acknowledges a\ndebt;\n(b) the instrument is issued in consideration of the provision of\ncredit; and\n(c) the instrument is issued in relation to a transaction that is not\na routine operational transaction;\nthe Corporation shall be taken to raise money otherwise than by\nborrowing and the amount of money raised shall be taken to be the\namount of the value of the credit provided.",
