    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:australian-broadcasting-corporation-act-1983-sec-70b-ss-9",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "70B(9) Borrowings otherwise than from Commonwealth",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/australian-broadcasting-corporation-act-1983#sec-70b-ss-9"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "australian-broadcasting-corporation-act-1983.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "australian-broadcasting-corporation-act-1983.pdf, p.58",
      "values:originalText": "(9) For the purposes of this section, if:\n(a) the Corporation obtains credit; and\n(b) the credit is obtained in relation to a transaction that is not a\nroutine operational transaction;\nthe Corporation shall be taken to raise money otherwise than by\nborrowing and the amount of money raised shall be taken to be the\namount of the value of the credit obtained.",
      "skos:definition": "(9) For the purposes of this section, if:\n(a) the Corporation obtains credit; and\n(b) the credit is obtained in relation to a transaction that is not a\nroutine operational transaction;\nthe Corporation shall be taken to raise money otherwise than by\nborrowing and the amount of money raised shall be taken to be the\namount of the value of the credit obtained.",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:australian-broadcasting-corporation-act-1983-sec-70b"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:australian-broadcasting-corporation-act-1983-sec-70b-ss-9-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:australian-broadcasting-corporation-act-1983-sec-70b-ss-9-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "1dadd3044e57b1d13cbb6f11199721620a75c08a845b9cbcccafe64a71587787",
      "skos:note": "The Corporation must raise money from credit obtained in non-routine transactions."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/australian-broadcasting-corporation-act-1983#sec-70b-ss-9",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "70B(9) Borrowings otherwise than from Commonwealth",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 58,
      "values:originalText": "(9) For the purposes of this section, if:\n(a) the Corporation obtains credit; and\n(b) the credit is obtained in relation to a transaction that is not a\nroutine operational transaction;\nthe Corporation shall be taken to raise money otherwise than by\nborrowing and the amount of money raised shall be taken to be the\namount of the value of the credit obtained."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:australian-broadcasting-corporation-act-1983-sec-70b-ss-9-norm",
      "@type": "values:Obligation",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
      },
      "values:partOf": {
