    {
      "@id": "concept:australian-broadcasting-corporation-act-1983-sec-70c",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "70C Guarantee of borrowings by Corporation",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/australian-broadcasting-corporation-act-1983#sec-70c"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "australian-broadcasting-corporation-act-1983.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "australian-broadcasting-corporation-act-1983.pdf, p.59",
      "values:originalText": "(1) The Finance Minister may, on behalf of the Commonwealth, enter\ninto a contract that:\n(a) guarantees the repayment of money borrowed under\nparagraph 70B(1)(a) and the payment of interest on that\nmoney; or\n(b) guarantees the payment of an amount that the Corporation is\nliable to pay in relation to money raised under\nparagraph 70B(1)(b).",
      "skos:definition": "(1) The Finance Minister may, on behalf of the Commonwealth, enter\ninto a contract that:\n(a) guarantees the repayment of money borrowed under\nparagraph 70B(1)(a) and the payment of interest on that\nmoney; or\n(b) guarantees the payment of an amount that the Corporation is\nliable to pay in relation to money raised under\nparagraph 70B(1)(b).",
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:australian-broadcasting-corporation-act-1983-sec-70c-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:australian-broadcasting-corporation-act-1983-sec-70c-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "0e43fa4a51ee5a68e9ebe983d608aa2bc946f9dec7ac71bbc6f998a5b3366c57",
      "skos:note": "Guarantee of repayments by Corporation"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/australian-broadcasting-corporation-act-1983#sec-70c",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "70C Guarantee of borrowings by Corporation",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 59,
      "values:originalText": "(1) The Finance Minister may, on behalf of the Commonwealth, enter\ninto a contract that:\n(a) guarantees the repayment of money borrowed under\nparagraph 70B(1)(a) and the payment of interest on that\nmoney; or\n(b) guarantees the payment of an amount that the Corporation is\nliable to pay in relation to money raised under\nparagraph 70B(1)(b)."
    },
    {
