    {
      "@id": "concept:australian-broadcasting-corporation-act-1983-sec-71a",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "71A Delegation by Finance Minister",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/australian-broadcasting-corporation-act-1983#sec-71a"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "australian-broadcasting-corporation-act-1983.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "australian-broadcasting-corporation-act-1983.pdf, p.61",
      "values:originalText": "(1) The Finance Minister may, by written instrument, delegate any of\nthe Finance Minister’s powers or functions under section 70B or\n70C to an official (within the meaning of the Public Governance,\nPerformance and Accountability Act 2013) of a non-corporate\nCommonwealth entity (within the meaning of that Act).\n(2) In exercising powers or functions under a delegation, the official\nmust comply with any directions of the Finance Minister.",
      "skos:definition": "(1) The Finance Minister may, by written instrument, delegate any of\nthe Finance Minister’s powers or functions under section 70B or\n70C to an official (within the meaning of the Public Governance,\nPerformance and Accountability Act 2013) of a non-corporate\nCommonwealth entity (within the meaning of that Act).\n(2) In exercising powers or functions under a delegation, the official\nmust comply with any directions of the Finance Minister.",
      "cml:hasPart": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:australian-broadcasting-corporation-act-1983-sec-71a-ss-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:australian-broadcasting-corporation-act-1983-sec-71a-ss-2"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "aa18bca201c9c8b8101d201b3deb14808daef1736ed96d4175304cfa8b213ab1"
    },
    {
