    {
      "@id": "concept:australian-broadcasting-corporation-act-1983-sec-80",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "80 Matters to be included in annual report",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/australian-broadcasting-corporation-act-1983#sec-80"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "australian-broadcasting-corporation-act-1983.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "australian-broadcasting-corporation-act-1983.pdf, p.69",
      "values:originalText": "The Directors must include in each annual report on the\nCorporation given to the Minister under section 46 of the Public\nGovernance, Performance and Accountability Act 2013 for a\nperiod:\n(a) particulars of each broadcast by the Corporation during the\nperiod pursuant to a direction by the Minister under\nsubsection 78(1); and\n(b) particulars of each provision of content by the Corporation\non a digital media service during the period in accordance\nwith a direction by the Minister under subsection 78(3A);\nand\n(c) particulars of any broadcast by the Corporation during the\nperiod pursuant to a direction by the Minister otherwise than\nunder this Act; and\n(ca) particulars of any provision of content by the Corporation on\na digital media service during the period in accordance with a\ndirection by the Minister otherwise than under this Act; and\n(d) particulars of any direction not to broadcast matter that was\ngiven to the Corporation during the period by the Minister\notherwise than under this Act; and",
      "skos:definition": "The Directors must include in each annual report on the\nCorporation given to the Minister under section 46 of the Public\nGovernance, Performance and Accountability Act 2013 for a\nperiod:\n(a) particulars of each broadcast by the Corporation during the\nperiod pursuant to a direction by the Minister under\nsubsection 78(1); and\n(b) particulars of each provision of content by the Corporation\non a digital media service during the period in accordance\nwith a direction by the Minister under subsection 78(3A);\nand\n(c) particulars of any broadcast by the Corporation during the\nperiod pursuant to a direction by the Minister otherwise than\nunder this Act; and\n(ca) particulars of any provision of content by the Corporation on\na digital media service during the period in accordance with a\ndirection by the Minister otherwise than under this Act; and\n(d) particulars of any direction not to broadcast matter that was\ngiven to the Corporation during the period by the Minister\notherwise than under this Act; and",
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:australian-broadcasting-corporation-act-1983-sec-80-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:australian-broadcasting-corporation-act-1983-sec-80-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "5c8960b7eb3623d43055d6cc83930626d23aab2caf522f2cc19bbc1b0e96cef5",
      "skos:note": "Directors must include specific information in annual reports.",
      "dc:description": "Yes"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/australian-broadcasting-corporation-act-1983#sec-80",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "80 Matters to be included in annual report",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 69,
      "values:originalText": "The Directors must include in each annual report on the\nCorporation given to the Minister under section 46 of the Public\nGovernance, Performance and Accountability Act 2013 for a\nperiod:\n(a) particulars of each broadcast by the Corporation during the\nperiod pursuant to a direction by the Minister under\nsubsection 78(1); and\n(b) particulars of each provision of content by the Corporation\non a digital media service during the period in accordance\nwith a direction by the Minister under subsection 78(3A);\nand\n(c) particulars of any broadcast by the Corporation during the\nperiod pursuant to a direction by the Minister otherwise than\nunder this Act; and\n(ca) particulars of any provision of content by the Corporation on\na digital media service during the period in accordance with a\ndirection by the Minister otherwise than under this Act; and\n(d) particulars of any direction not to broadcast matter that was\ngiven to the Corporation during the period by the Minister\notherwise than under this Act; and"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:australian-broadcasting-corporation-act-1983-sec-80-norm",
      "@type": "values:Obligation",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
      },
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:australian-broadcasting-corporation-act-1983-sec-80"
      },
      "values:deonticStatus": {
        "@id": "values:HeuristicDerived"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "values:borneBy": {
        "@id": "values:Agent"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:australian-broadcasting-corporation-act-1983-sec-80-logic-deontic-1",
      "@type": "cml:LogicApplication",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
      },
      "cml:operator": "MUST",
      "cml:logicSummary": "Must provide specified information.",
      "cml:executionSurface": "modalities::logic::deontic",
      "cml:confidence": {
        "@value": 1.0,
        "@type": "xsd:decimal"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:australian-broadcasting-corporation-act-1983-sec-81",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "81 Joint Consultative Committee",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/australian-broadcasting-corporation-act-1983#sec-81"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "australian-broadcasting-corporation-act-1983.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "australian-broadcasting-corporation-act-1983.pdf, p.70",
      "values:originalText": "(1) There is hereby established a Joint Consultative Committee\ncomprising:\n(a) representatives of the Corporation; and\n(b) either or both of the following:\n(i) representatives of organizations of employees of the\nCorporation;\n(ii) representatives of employees of the Corporation.\n(2) The rules shall make provision for and in relation to the manner in\nwhich the Joint Consultative Committee is to be constituted, the\nfunctions of that Committee and the manner in which that\nCommittee is to carry out its functions.\n\n\nMiscellaneous  Part VIII\n\nSection 83\nAustralian Broadcasting Corporation Act 1983\nCompilation date: 18/02/2022\nRegistered: 23/02/2022",
      "skos:definition": "(1) There is hereby established a Joint Consultative Committee\ncomprising:\n(a) representatives of the Corporation; and\n(b) either or both of the following:\n(i) representatives of organizations of employees of the\nCorporation;\n(ii) representatives of employees of the Corporation.\n(2) The rules shall make provision for and in relation to the manner in\nwhich the Joint Consultative Committee is to be constituted, the\nfunctions of that Committee and the manner in which that\nCommittee is to carry out its functions.\n\n\nMiscellaneous  Part VIII\n\nSection 83\nAustralian Broadcasting Corporation Act 1983\nCompilation date: 18/02/2022\nRegistered: 23/02/2022",
      "cml:hasPart": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:australian-broadcasting-corporation-act-1983-sec-81-ss-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:australian-broadcasting-corporation-act-1983-sec-81-ss-2"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "2ac96329e0a550be911b758208c207ba57d58fc35045af01d4ad1519e4688616"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/australian-broadcasting-corporation-act-1983#sec-81",
